      "note": "Coding-agent VM (one per thread, Ubuntu 24.04, backed by Daytona per subprocessor list). Billed per hour by size only while awake (+2 min wind-down); sleeps ~2 min after the agent stops; asleep = free, disk kept (cold after 2 days, deleted after 30 days). Size is set per project. Cannot be kept awake arbitrarily (only +5 min prepaid extensions, up to 30 min ahead). Model tokens billed separately from the same credit balance. Size table (docs.capy.ai/models-and-pricing, verified 2026-09-29): Small 1/4/64 $0.10, Medium 2/8/64 $0.20, Large 4/16/64 $0.40 (default), Ultra 8/32/64 $0.80, Hyper 16/64/128 $1.60 per hour; Big Guy 16/128/256 $3.20 is Enterprise-only (not priced here). boot_overhead_s 120 = the 2-minute billed wind-down per awake period. Billing granularity not stated."
